msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Feel free to leave the girl with me while you go handle\r\n"
"your business with Majima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Thanks, Emoto. I appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I hear you're leaving Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah, now that everything's settled down. By the way, how's\r\n"
"Kazuki doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"He'll be fine soon enough. It's still some time 'til he'll\r\n"
"be out on the street, but he's progressing nicely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Good to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Did you drop in on the Tojo Clan yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Nope, and I'm not planning to. Daigo and Yayoi-san have\r\n"
"enough on their plates already rebuilding the organization.\r\n"
"Besides, the Tojo don't need me now that Daigo's in charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "I wouldn't be so sure about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"It's all right. I left a letter for Daigo over with\r\n"
"Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "There is one thing I need, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Hm? What's that?"
msgstr "Mmm? Cos'è quello?"

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I need to see a certain someone before I leave Kamurocho\r\n"
"for good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "...Majima. You're gonna ask him to look after Daigo, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Yeah. If we want all the other families to accept Daigo\r\n"
"as their leader, we need a big man like Majima to come\r\n"
"forward and do it first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Can't you just step in if anyone starts giving him trouble?\r\n"
"Why's it have to be Majima?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "I'm out of the clan, that's why. Besides..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"It's not that long ago that the Tojo wanted me dead. Even\r\n"
"now, I have my fair share of enemies in the clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Meaning the Mad Dog's your only option."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"That's right. None of the patriarchs would dare mess with\r\n"
"Majima, but if Daigo can show he's got him on a leash..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"The other families would have to follow suit. I get it.\r\n"
"...So, you're gonna go see him now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Yeah. Mind if I leave Haruka here while I'm out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "What, the girl? Of course, of course. No problem at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Thanks, Emoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4016"
msgid "Emoto"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4020"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4024"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4028"
msgid "Talk_No"
msgstr ""
